  "definition": "Emergency Transfers to the Unit",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-07-25",
  "historyNote": "#7299, eff 5-25-00, EXPIRED: 5-25-08 New. #9229, EMERGENCY, eff 8-5-08, EXPIRES: 2-1-09; ss by #9371, eff 2-1-09, EXPIRED: 2-1-17 New. #12104, INTERIM, eff 2-14-17, EXPIRES: 8-13-17; ss by #12341, eff 7-25-17",
